<title>USA: Western Water names Beeman CFO.</title>
<headline>Western Water names Beeman CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Water Co said on Wednesday that it has named Edward Beeman chief financial officer.</p>
<p>According to a company press release, Beeman was previously chief financial officer of Bird Medical Technologies Inc in Palm Springs, California.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to say who Beeman replaces.</p>
</text>
